<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LHS Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LHS Group started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of LHS Group Inc with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs was the lead underwriter of LHS Group's May 16 initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- LHS Group lost 1-1/4 to 38.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- LHS shares were off 2-1/4 at 37.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
